# PERPETUAL-EXPANSION.1 fixtures.
# Test/Perpetual: perpetual year-parity rules (`1990 max even/odd`) — the recurring tail is NOT
# POSIX-footer-expressible (a TZ string cannot encode "even years"), so footer synthesis fails closed
# by default and only the empty-footer fallback (`--legacy-empty-footer`) compiles it.
Rule	P	1990	max	-	Oct	lastSun	2:00	1:00	D
Rule	P	1990	max	even	Mar	Sun>=18	2:00	0	S
Rule	P	1990	max	odd	Mar	Sun>=1	2:00	0	S
Zone	Test/Perpetual	10:00	P	E%sT
# Test/Normal: an ordinary POSIX-expressible recurring pair (one perpetual DST + one perpetual standard)
# — synthesises a real footer; the empty-footer flag is a NO-OP for it.
Rule	N	1990	max	-	Oct	lastSun	2:00	1:00	D
Rule	N	1990	max	-	Mar	lastSun	2:00	0	S
Zone	Test/Normal	10:00	N	E%sT
